,\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A passionate and tumultuous love story set against the backdrop of the Yorkshire moors, exploring the intense and destructive relationship between Heathcliff and Catherine Earnshaw.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A passionate and tumultuous love story set against the backdrop of the Yorkshire moors, exploring the intense and destructive relationship between Heathcliff and Catherin\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":136,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i39w-wDZZuU\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000122\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004435\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005031\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005648\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005651\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007272\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007273\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013130\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"11246\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000033\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3869f393-3342-4dc1-9c0a-a7d04e170132\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006762\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008342\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Warners\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006777\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: It's Never Over, Jeff Buckley\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"IT’S NEVER OVER, JEFF BUCKLEY, directed by Oscar-nominated filmmaker Amy Berg, covers the life of the rising young star with an otherworldly voice and boundary-pushing artistry, who left the '90s music world reeling when he died suddenly, at age 30, after the release of his critically acclaimed debut album “Grace.”\\r\\n\\r\\